              <calculation class='tableau' formula='// BR Incident Body&#13;&#10;// Ready-to-send message for the email action (calc pack 5.2, written by the build).&#13;&#10;CASE STR([Parameters].[Parameter 1]) + &quot;|&quot; + [Parameters].[Parameter 4]&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;7|source.acme_core.raw_dbt_artifacts.run_results&quot; THEN &quot;Heads up: raw_dbt_artifacts.run_results (sources, Snowflake) is being changed. It feeds 1 data product used by about 5 people, apps or agents a day. Treat these numbers with caution until we confirm the fix.&quot;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;7|source.acme_product.raw_events.app_events&quot; THEN &quot;Heads up: raw_events.app_events (sources, Databricks) is being changed. It feeds 3 data products used by about 29 people, apps or agents a day. Treat these numbers with caution until we confirm the fix.&quot;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;7|source.acme_product.raw_events.page_views&quot; THEN &quot;Heads up: raw_events.page_views (sources, Databricks) is being changed. It feeds 6 data products used by about 49 people, apps or agents a day. Treat these numbers with caution until we confirm the fix.&quot;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;7|source.acme_product.raw_events.search_events&quot; THEN &quot;Heads up: raw_events.search_events (sources, Databricks) is being changed. It feeds 6 data products used by about 49 people, apps or agents a day. Treat these numbers with caution until we confirm the fix.&quot;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;7|source.acme_product.raw_events.web_sessions&quot; THEN &quot;Heads up: raw_events.web_sessions (sources, Databricks) is being changed. It feeds 6 data products used by about 49 people, apps or agents a day. Treat these numbers with caution until we confirm the fix.&quot;&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;7|source.acme_product.raw_experiments.assignments&quot; THEN &quot;Heads up: raw_experiments.assignments (sources, Databricks) is being changed. It feeds 1 data product used by about 2 people, apps or agents a day. Treat these numbers with caution until