                    </zone>
                    <zone h='43800' id='1595' type-v2='text' w='51812' x='17312' y='51500'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>188 actions in all. Every page also has the Period, Platform and ⓘ buttons (p_period, p_platform, p_show_info).</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Health overview</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>35 parameter writes (p_selected_exposure, p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key, p_panel_*, p_tile_view); 5 go to Lineage explorer; 6 highlight resets</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Run &amp; failures</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>9 parameter writes (p_gantt_date, p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key, p_panel_*); 1 go to Blast radius; 4 highlight resets</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Freshness &amp; SLAs</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>7 parameter writes (p_selected_exposure, p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key, p_panel_*); 1 go to Lineage explorer; 1 highlight reset</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Lineage explorer</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>13 parameter writes (p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key, p_lineage_view, p_panel_*); 3 highlight resets</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Blast radius</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>13 parameter writes (p_selected_exposure, p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key, p_panel_*); 1 go to Lineage explorer; 1 email link; 3 highlight resets</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Performance &amp; cost</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>6 parameter writes (p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key, p_panel_*); 1 go to Blast radius; 1 highlight reset</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Usage &amp; adoption</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>20 parameter writes (p_selected_exposure, p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key, p_panel_*); 3 go to Blast radius / Lineage explorer; 3 highlight resets</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='5'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8' bold='true'>Governance</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>14 parameter writes (p_selected_exposure, p_panel_*, p_selected_node, p_selected_node_key); 2 go to Lineage explorer; 2 highlight resets</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                      </formatted-text>
