                    </zone>
                    <zone h='43800' id='1598' type-v2='text' w='25062' x='72125' y='51500'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7' bold='true'>SHEET PREFIXES</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>GL shared on every page; HO, RUN, FR, LIN, BR, QA, PF, US, GOV, AB and DOC for each page.</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='6'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7' bold='true'>DYNAMIC ZONE VISIBILITY</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Every DZV calc reads parameters only; one that read the data kept its first value.</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='6'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7' bold='true'>CANVASES</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Tables, chips and lists are drawn on map layers with fixed axes, their text placed from widths measured at build time.</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='6'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7' bold='true'>KNOWN COMPROMISES</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Values that change with period and platform are worked out by the build and switched by parameters. Run &amp; failures has no MTTR window shading.</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='6'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7' bold='true'>REBUILD</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>python3 tableau/tools/build_workbook.py --tag &lt;version&gt;. Every build is kept in tableau/versions with a row in CHANGELOG.md.</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#4a5563' fontname='Arial' fontsize='6'>Æ&#10;</run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#e6e7e2' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
